senses.gloss:
1. शील् (rather Nom. fr. शील below) cl. 1. P. शीलति (pf. शिशील &c.), to meditate, contemplate, Dhātup. xv, 16;
to serve, worship, ib.;
to act, do, practise, make, ib. :
Caus. (or cl. 10. P. Dhātup. xxxv, 26) शीलयति (aor. अशिशीलत्), to do, make, practise repeatedly or exceedingly, be intent upon or engaged in (acc.), exercise, cultivate, Āpast.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to wear, put on Gīt.;
to visit, frequent, Bhām. (cf. शीलित);
to exceed, excel, Vop.
